WEBVTT

00:08:30.813 --> 00:08:33.599
HE: Thank you, Chad.

00:08:33.599 --> 00:08:36.421
With this drone setup, we show the potential

00:08:36.421 --> 00:08:38.887
for bedridden people to once again be able

00:08:38.887 --> 00:08:41.558
to explore the outside world,

00:08:41.558 --> 00:08:43.935
and robotics will eventually provide

00:08:43.935 --> 00:08:45.278
a level playing field

00:08:45.278 --> 00:08:47.981
where one is only limited by their mental acuity

00:08:47.981 --> 00:08:50.226
and imagination,

00:08:50.226 --> 00:08:52.385
where the disabled are able to perform

00:08:52.385 --> 00:08:55.080
the same activities as everyone else,

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.982
and perhaps better,

00:08:57.982 --> 00:09:00.622
and technology will even allow us to provide